From ff6b5dddd0a54170355fc1924844daff3ae9cfbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:08:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(cli): prototype fuse add / fuse gen with
 manifest-driven TS wrappers, dev validation and catalogue

Analyzer generator moves to packages/solid-fuse/gen (standalone Dart package),
emits Dart adapters plus a JSON manifest per unit. The CLI derives the TS
wrapper module, the catalogue, the dev-mode validation prelude and fuse.lock
from the manifest. examples/gen_e2e proves the pipeline on Linux desktop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
